book python_balances v1
description "An account the Python client writes as the method _r of _Balances, which keeps what its methods call through in its attribute _r"

unit pcs

account stock(sku: string) : pcs
  at least 0 refused as out_of_stock
account _r : pcs outside
account customers : pcs outside

transfer receive(delivery: string, sku: string, qty: pcs)
  key delivery, sku
  move qty from _r to stock(sku)

transfer ship(order: string, sku: string, qty: pcs)
  key order, sku
  move qty from stock(sku) to customers
